Package: mighty.component
Title: Mighty Components for ADaM Generation
Version: 0.1.0.9008
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aksel", "Thomsen", , "oath@novonordisk.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Matthew", "Phelps", , "mewp@novonordisk.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Novo Nordisk A/S", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Reusable code templates ('components') for the 'mighty'
    framework, used to generate Analysis Data Model (ADaM) programs.
    Components are 'Mustache' templates documented with 'roxygen2'-like
    tags. They can be retrieved from local directories, 'GitHub' or
    URLs, rendered with study-specific parameters, validated,
    evaluated, and unit tested with code coverage.
